Save into a slot the page asks for, between turns of the main loop

The page around the engine asks now and then for a save in a given slot
(engines/lib/overseer.js). The main loop takes the request at the end of a
turn, when the player could have made a quick save: outside combat and
conversations, while the game takes orders, with the player alive. The save
is made the way a quick save is once its slot is known, described as
"AUTOSAVE hh:mm", and leaves the slot the player last picked alone.

The main loop also tells the page when it starts and when it ends: while
it runs, a game is in progress.
